(builder/props/variants/slots/metadata), styles + variable modes, breakpoints, CMS draft semantics, publish/branches, scripts, forms, localization, sites, assets/compression, webhooks, enterprise, AI tools, agent instructions, WHTML, utility tools, rate limits, and local-OSS vs remote-surface reconciliation. Cite [SOURCE: file:line] or [SOURCE: url] for every finding; flag conciseness gaps and missing logic as P0/P1/P2 with concrete recommendations.\",\"maxIterations\":5,\"minIterations\":3,\"convergenceThreshold\":0.05,\"antiConvergence\":{\"convergenceMode\":\"off\",\"stopPolicy\":\"max-iterations\",\"divergent\":{}},\"stopPolicy\":\"max-iterations\",\"stuckThreshold\":3,\"specFolder\":\".opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-luna-max-fast-1785753078466-rijm2e\",\"executor\":{\"kind\":\"cli-opencode\",\"model\":\"openai/gpt-5.6-luna-fast\"},\"fanout\":{\"lineage_label\":\"luna-max-fast\",\"artifact_dir\":\".opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/luna-max-fast\"},\"stopPolicy\":\"max-iterations\",\"convergenceMode\":\"off\"}\n{\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"spec_check_result\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"folder_state\":\"detached-lineage-no-mutation\",\"normalized_topic\":\"audit mcp webflow skill packet official webflow mcp 2 0 surface concision missing logic\",\"specFolder\":\".opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps\",\"artifactDir\":\".opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/luna-max-fast\",\"reason\":\"Detached lineage scope forbids writes outside artifact_dir\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-luna-max-fast-1785753078466-rijm2e\",\"generation\":1}\n{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":1,\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Res