\n## 6A. DIVERGENT PIVOTS\n- Completed pivots: 0\n- Failed pivots: 0\n- Audited overrides: 0\n- Saturated: none yet\n- Pivot lineage: none yet\n- Remaining frontier: none recorded\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:divergent-pivots -->\n<!-- ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n## 7. NEXT FOCUS\nFollow up on: **P2 — Rate-limit guidance is generic and SAFE-003 is not a reproducible endpoint-aware test.** The local wiring/troubleshooting contract covers plan rates, `X-RateLimit-*`, `Retry-After`, and the one-publish-per-minu...\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n<!-- ANCHOR:active-risks -->\n## 8. ACTIVE RISKS\n- None active beyond normal research uncertainty.\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:active-risks -->\n<!-- ANCHOR:blocked-stops -->\n## 9. BLOCKED STOPS\nNo blocked-stop events recorded.\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:blocked-stops -->\n<!-- ANCHOR:graph-convergence -->\n## 10. GRAPH CONVERGENCE\n- graphConvergenceScore: 0.00\n- graphDecision: [Not recorded]\n- graphBlockers: none recorded\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:graph-convergence -->","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":134,"totalLines":134,"truncated":false}},"title":".opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/luna-max-fast/deep-research-dashboard.md","time":{"start":1785758294865,"end":1785758294881}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_03f4669166d264b4016a708256992481919278ddb9d3e9b8b5"}},"id":"prt_fc77d23010016I8rKGpuUJNnsv","sessionID":"ses_0388746ecffe5jux7SFKY5sCCH","messageID":"msg_fc77cc96600150raIrl9Txf7jm"}}
