 boundary, element tree, components (builder/props/variants/slots/metadata), styles + variable modes, breakpoints, CMS draft semantics, publish/branches, scripts, forms, localization, sites, assets/compression, webhooks, enterprise, AI tools, agent instructions, WHTML, utility tools, rate limits, and local-OSS vs remote-surface reconciliation. Cite [SOURCE: file:line] or [SOURCE: url] for every finding; flag conciseness gaps and missing logic as P0/P1/P2 with concrete recommendations.\",\"maxIterations\":5,\"minIterations\":3,\"convergenceThreshold\":0.05,\"antiConvergence\":{\"convergenceMode\":\"off\",\"stopPolicy\":\"max-iterations\",\"divergent\":{}},\"stopPolicy\":\"max-iterations\",\"stuckThreshold\":3,\"specFolder\":\".opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-luna-max-fast-1785753078466-rijm2e\",\"executor\":{\"kind\":\"cli-opencode\",\"model\":\"openai/gpt-5.6-luna-fast\"},\"fanout\":{\"lineage_label\":\"luna-max-fast\",\"artifact_dir\":\".opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/luna-max-fast\"},\"stopPolicy\":\"max-iterations\",\"convergenceMode\":\"off\"}\n\n  Line 2: {\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"spec_check_result\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"folder_state\":\"detached-lineage-no-mutation\",\"normalized_topic\":\"audit mcp webflow skill packet official webflow mcp 2 0 surface concision missing logic\",\"specFolder\":\".opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps\",\"artifactDir\":\".opencode/specs/mcp-tooling/015-mcp-webflow/011-deep-research-quality-gaps/research/lineages/luna-max-fast\",\"reason\":\"Detached lineage scope forbids writes outside artifact_dir\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-luna-max-fast-1785753078466-rijm2e\",\"generation\":1}\n\n  Line 3: {\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":1,\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"run\":1,\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Audit the local packet and official Designer/Bridge App surface: page, mode, branch, component view, selection, element tree, components and their props/variants/slots/metadata, styles, variable modes, and breakpoints.\",\"findingsCount\":8,\"newInfoRatio\":1.0,\"noveltyJustification\":\"Eight distinct Designer/Bridge packet gaps were newly identified by triangulating official Webflow documentation, the official repository README, and exact local action/card anchors.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"Q1\",\"Q5\",\"Q6\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"Q1\"],\"ruledOut\":[\"CMS, publishing, scripts, forms, localization, sites, assets, webhooks, Enterprise, AI, WHTML, utility tools, and rate limits were deferred by the one-focus prompt\",\"The unavailable guessed hosted documentation path was not retried verbatim; canonical official MCP documentation and the repository README were used instead\"],\"focusTrack\":\"designer-bridge\",\"edgeCase\":\"contradictory-evidence\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Read\",\"Glob\",\"Grep\",\"WebFetch\",\"Bash\",\"apply_patch\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\"https://developers.webflow.com/mcp\",\"https://developers.webflow.com/data/docs/ai-tools/mcp-server\",\"https://github.com/webflow/mcp-server\",\".opencode/skills/mcp-tooling/mcp-webflow/references/designer-capabilities.md\",\".opencode/skills/mcp-tooling/mcp-webflow/references/action-reference.md\",\".opencode/skills/mcp-tooling/mcp-webflow/references/mcp-wiring.md\",\".opencode/skills/mcp-tooling/mcp-webflow/feature-catalog/design/designer.md\",\".opencode/skills/mcp-tooling/mcp-webflow/feature-catalog/design/component-variants.md\",\".opencode/skills/mcp-tooling/mcp-webflow/manual-testing-playbook/designer-edit/designer-edit.md\",\".opencode/skills/mcp-tooling/mcp-webflow/manual-testing-playbook/discovery-setup/remote-surface.md\",\".opencode/skills/mcp-tool